Find the Maximum Number in an Array

Write a function that returns the largest number.

Examples:

[3, 7, 2, 9, 4] → 9
[-5, -2, -10] → -2
[8] → 8

Constraints:

Don't use Math.max().
Try to solve it in one loop.



Solution:


const num = [3, 7, 2, 9, 4];
let max = 0;

for (let i = 0; i < num.length; i++) {
  if (max < num[i]) {
    max = num[i];
  }
}

console.log(max);
